"""Line icons for the app's HTML (map popups, beach card, Conoce panel).

The shapes are Lucide icons (https://lucide.dev, ISC licence, v0.460.0), inlined
as SVG so they render inside Leaflet popups and st.markdown HTML with no font or
network request. They draw in ``currentColor``, so an icon takes the colour of
the text it sits in.

Streamlit widget labels cannot hold HTML; those use Streamlit's own
``:material/...:`` icons instead (see beaches.py).
"""

